  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Carefully use spudger to release lens, then lift lens out of camera with fingers. CAUTION: LENS MAY POP OUT OF CAMERA; REMOVE CAREFULLY.</has_title>
