  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the four ZIF ribbon cables highlighted in red by using the following procedure: Use your fingernail to flip up the ZIF cable retaining flap on each socket. Be sure you are prying up the retaining flap, '''not''' the socket. Pull the ribbon cable straight out of its socket.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</has_order>
