  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">With the case and LCD screen removed, you are ready to remove the release button. Begin by using the Philips #00 screwdriver to remove two silver 0.159in screws on the top and front of the camera.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">12</has_order>
