  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Rotate the camcorder so that the tape compartment is facing you. Remove the single 4.5mm black screw, which is above the hook for the hand strap. It may help you during this step to undo the strap on one end. Next, rotate the camcorder so that the lens is facing you. Remove the single 4.5mm black screw from the front panel.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</has_order>
