  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Open the LCD screen on the side of the camcorder. Using a #00 screwdriver, remove the two 4.5mm silver screws located on either side of the hinge of the LCD screen.</has_title>
