  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Flash capacitors are dangerous! Be ''extremely'' careful when removing the capacitor from the camera. You can get shocked ''BADLY''! Remove the flash capacitor from the lens assembly. Carefully place the flash capacitor away from where you are working.</has_title>
