  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Gently slide the circuit board out away from the port connections. Pull it toward where the lens used to be. Some wiggling may be necessary to remove. The circuit board is fitted into slots attached to the side of the camera. Do not angle upwards to remove.</has_title>
