  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">After removing the AV circuit board you are left with the front casing attached to the inner casing and flash unit. First you must remove two 3.5mm blue screws near the hole of the lens that attach the inner casing.</has_title>
