  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Follow the small data cable to where it connects to the camera. Lift the back white portion to unlock the cable. The cable should easily slide out. The connector is very fragile. Use caution when lifting the lock.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</has_order>
