  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Release the ZIF connector securing the next ribbon cable. To do this, insert the flat end of a spudger between the dark brown piece and the white piece of the connector. Since the dark brown piece is under the ribbon cable, move this piece to the right by wedging one end at a time.</has_title>
