  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Position the camera so that the motherboard is facing you. Remove the plastic flap covering the motherboard. Place edge of iPod Opening Tool in the small opening between the battery and the motherboard. Pry the battery off of the motherboard using the iPod Opening Tool.</has_title>
