  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Follow the instructions in the prerequisite guide Disassembling the Canon PowerShot A200 Case. Use the ''Phillips screwdriver'' to unscrew the 7 screws that hold the camera body to the camera case.  The location of the screws are noted in the photo. Set the screws aside. Pull out the camera body from the outside camera casing. Use the ''metal tweezers'' to unplug the connector from the other side of the camera case.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

