  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Use the ''metal tweezers'' to remove the orange ribbon from the top, back of the camera body. Use your fingers to gently remove the damaged or malfunctioning lens from the camera body. Note: When removing the lens, be aware that small pieces may fall out. Install a new camera lens by following the instructions in ''reverse'' order.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">11</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

