  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Use an unfolded paper clip to push the speaker from the top of the casing out towards the bottom. You may need to use a bit of force as the speaker be glued in to the top casing. There is a soft fabric speaker cover separating the speaker from the casing. Make sure not to remove it from its position in the housing.</has_title>
