  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Carefully remove the L shaped frame from the camera At the bottom of the camera the L shaped frame is being held in by two plastic bumps and a metal tab. Pop the frame off the bumps and tabs. Note: There is a yellow and orange wire soldered onto the camera. Be careful not to pull them off. The blue box is the speaker</has_title>
