  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Locate the black pludger sticking up out of the flash shoe. The black pludger may not be visible, which is why the flash is broken. Just locate the hole to where it should be and move on to the next step.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</has_order>
