  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Peel the black tape off of the back surface of the LCD Unscrew 4-3mm screws, on the LCD bracket Unscrew 2-2mm screws from the top of the bracket Lastly using a spudger, pop the LCD out of the camera back plate. When the bracket comes off, be aware that the buttons from the top section will fall out of place if the plate is inverted.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

