  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove all of the screws that hold the back plate in place. Unscrew the 4mm screw that is directly to the right of the viewfinder. On the base, Unscrew the 3mm screw in the top left corner. Unscrew all four 3mm screws under the battery cover. Unscrew the 3mm screw on the right side panel. Unscrew the two 2mm screws on the left side panel. The bullets apply to the three pictures on the step.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</has_order>
