  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In order to remove the LCD from its mount, carefully pry up the four tabs along the top and bottom edges of the screen. There is a reflector sheet under the screen that is easily scratched. Try not to touch the reflector as it is nearly impossible to clean. You have now successfully disassembled the LCD.</has_title>
