  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Locate the 3 screws on the camera that hold the front cover of the camera to the camera body. The first 2 are located on the bottom of the camera. The last screw is located behind the flash module. Turn the camera on, and raise the flash module to locate the flash module screw.</has_title>
