  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Separate the back casing and front casing of the camera using your hands. Pulling the two halves apart can be difficult, especially at the top. Use a moderate amount of force.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">11</has_order>
