  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Carefully remove the top most piece of the upper frame as indicated in the picture. You may need to manipulate the pieces of the frame until they disconnect from one another. The two side pieces should "fall" off after this piece is removed.</has_title>
