  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Disconnect the two plastic ribbons on the lower half of the right motherboard. NOTE: You will have to lift up the brown plastic piece in order to pull out the second ribbon wire.</has_title>
