  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Slide the LCD screen down and out of the frame, so that the two ribbon cables underneath are now visible. The main ribbon cable uses a clip to secure the cable to the connector. The smaller ribbon cable uses a compression clip to secure the cable to the connector. Push the compression clip away from the connector with your fingernail or a small tool. Moving the clip a few millimeters will fully detach the LCD from the camera. Install the new LCD screen.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

