  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the two black screws threaded vertically into the top of the viewfinder. Loosen the flash and circuit board for more accessibility.  This will allow for the viewfinder to be replaced.</has_title>
