  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Open the battery door Rotate the door so the one side of the hinge pops out (see photo #2) Slide other pin out (it pops out the same, but this is easier)</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</has_order>
