  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove these screws. There are also 2 screws that hold the small metal piece at the bottom of the image on - remove those as well (not circled in picture). In the middle of the orange ribbon there is another screw that needs removing (below the top-right screw that is circled in the image). Remove that as well for a total of 7 screws.</has_title>
