  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Using a Phillips #00 precision screwdriver, remove the four 3mm screws holding the mode dial and power switch/shutter button in place. Remove the metal mounts from the underside of the dials. The dials are now free from the camera.</has_title>
