  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Disconnect the ribbon cable from the left side of the camera. You can do this by lifting  the small black strip with your nail and rotating it 60 degrees on top of the connector. These connectors are fragile so don't use to much force. Now you can easily take the flat cable out (same for the other connectors).</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">10</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

