  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The lens should now be free to simply be pushed out of its socket. The black and red wires that were exposed previously may be in the way of removing the lens and may break. If they do, you will need to solder these wires back into place upon reassembly.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9</has_order>
