  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Electric shock is a huge risk if the battery is not removed while taking the camera apart. Press down and forward on the battery cover latch. Push the orange latch, in the direction of the arrow on it, to release the battery.</has_title>
