  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the gray rubber cover labeled DC IN DIGITAL A/V OUT if it hasn't fallen out yet on its own. Carefully pull the front panel away from all the interior components of the digital camera.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">7</has_order>
