  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove both of the two 2.5 mm phillips head screws that attaches the shutter button to the digital camera front panel case. Hold out your hand to catch the shutter button and its components when they fall out.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">8</has_order>
