  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Open compartment door. Remove battery. Batteries contain highly acidic contents. If yours has leaked or ruptured while inside the compartment, there may be damage to the cameras circuitry. Clean out any residue using latex gloves and  tissues. For loose compartment doors, check the hinge or the locking pieces under the rubber pad (simply unscrew and remove the rubber and metal plate).</has_title>
