  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">With the camera lying face down, separate the tape that connects the rest of the lens using tweezers. Gently remove the lens display using your fingers out of the camera body. Take caution not to damage any of the ribbon cables that might still be attached. The lens assembly is now removed from the camera body and is able to be replaced if necessary.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">12</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

