  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Test the heat of the soldering iron by touching it to the tip of a paperclip. If the tip of the paperclip melts, the iron should be ready. If you have never used a soldering iron before, please consult the tutorial in the description of this guide, or watch the following video:  [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aP_ebVWYzSk|How To Solder] Or [guide|750|Soldering Techniques].</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">16</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

