  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the 4, 2 mm  screws from each corner of the metal screen cover. The larger metal piece is the side the screen is on. Be aware of a detachable metal separator under the top left screw.</has_title>
