  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Use a spudger to lift the brown lock tab. Avoid using metal pry tools, as shown in the photo, on internal electronic components, as it can cause a short and damage the device. Use an ESD-safe tool such as a standard nylon spudger. Using tweezers, lift the ribbon cable from the brown lock tab.</has_title>
