  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Open the flash and use a plastic opening tool to pop the tab under it as shown. Now pull the casing apart. The tripod attachment may fall out on its own, or you will need to pull it out.</has_title>
