  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Take note of the small free moving flap near the battery port seen in the first of the three photos. Be sure to store the free moving flap in a safe place. Pry the front cover off gently. Use a plastic opening tool if available. Now pry the back cover off gently, using a plastic opening tool if available.</has_title>
