  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the two Phillips #000 screws, 5 mm in length, from the I/O board. Remove the one Phillips #000 screw, 3 mm in length, from the I/O board.</has_title>
