  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Before taking out the two silver Phillips #00 screws, note the orientation of the two silver metal rings between the screw heads and the function dial. These rings will fall out once the screws are removed, and their orientation must be correct upon re-assembly in order for the function dial to work. Remove the two silver Phillips #00 2.5 mm screws attached to the bottom of the dial on the inside of the top panel.</has_title>
