  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove small axis with a pair of good pliers. The axis needs to be removed as otherwise the zoom lens will not come off easily Last picture shows the assembly with zoom lens still on. '''When lifting the zoom lens, the stabilizer lens will swing up. Remember this upon assembly, as you will have to move it back (down) again'''</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">12</has_order>
