  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">'''Gently''' disconnect the two ribbon wires from the camera. Use tweezers or a spudger to remove them. To remove these cables, pull them straight out of their sockets. When reassembling, be sure you plug these cables into the sockets fully. You will hear a  faint click when they are fully in.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

