  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Lift the top casing up and away from the camera. I'm not sure what this is for, but make sure the black plastic bit (not a cable) goes into the white plastic bit, as shown on the picture. Here is a view of the black plastic bit. It is on the underside of the top cover.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">22</has_order>
