  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Gently pry off the back casing. Before completely removing the back casing, be sure to disconnect the single ribbon cable running from the motherboard to the LCD display. Use a spudger to lift the tab on the ribbon cable's ZIF connector. Gently pull the ribbon cable out of the connector.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">11</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

