  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Separate the top casing from the electrical components enough to expose the wire harnesses that will need to be disconnected. Ensure to remove the casing gently.  There are several wire harnesses connecting the motherboard to components on the casing.</has_title>
