  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Gently pry back the rubber pad on the back of the camera with a metal spudger or other tool, or your fingernail, to reveal a hidden screw. Remove the 4-mm screw.</has_title>
