  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Take the LCD out of its place to expose the  Phillips  #PH00 screws. Start by removing the two 2.5 mm Phillips  #PH00 black screws on both sides of the LCD screen. Now remove the two  3 mm Phillips  #PH00 black screws near both sides of the base where the screen swivels.</has_title>
