  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Locate the four 8.1mm PH00 screws on the corners of the GoPro and unscrew them using the phillips screwdriver. Gently remove the motherboard by using a plastic opening tool to pry it out of the housing. Be careful not to damage the ribbon cable connected to the GoPro housing and motherboard.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

