  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove two 3 mm x 4 mm Phillips head screws from where the camera grip was just removed. Remove one 2 mm x 3 mm Phillips head screw from the same location as above. Remove one 3 mm x 5.5 mm Phillips head screw from the top right side of the camera shown. Remove one 3 mm x 3 mm Phillips head screw from the top left side of the camera shown. Gently lift the top of the camera up to separate it from the main body of the camera. At this point, it will still be connected via wires.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

