  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Soldering irons are hot. Take all necessary precautions before soldering to prevent damage to the camera or yourself. De-solder the wire shown on the grip side of the camera to allow sufficient access to the top of the camera.</has_title>
