  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Take the needle nose tweezers to remove the black ring in the middle of the button. You have successfully removed the zoom trigger and can replace with a new one if needed. To reassemble follow steps in reverse.</has_title>
