  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Firmly grasp the left side of the motherboard. Pull out the motherboard. If you find it difficult to remove the motherboard, pull it away from the HDMI panel while pulling it out.</has_title>
