  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Do not pull hard when removing the backing because it could rip the orange strip attached to the motherboard. Gently pull off the back of the camera from the left side so that it is partially open. Use a spudger to lift up the tab holding the orange strip and slide the strip out to disconnect it Refer to the next step to see pictures of how to properly use the spudger when removing a strip.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

