  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the three 2.6 mm screws located in the top two corners and the bottom right corner of the motherboard using a Phillips #000 Screwdriver. Lift the motherboard so it is out of your way to remove the lens. You do not need to desolder the motherboard to reach the lens.</has_title>
