  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Once the flash cover has been removed, unscrew the two silver 3mm Phillips head screws located on the top of the flash head. Do not touch the metal leads on either side of the flash, and avoid touching any metal. The capacitor may be charged and it will shock you.</has_title>
