  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Once the screws have been removed, pull the flash bulb out from the camera. Then remove the flash from the camera by soldering the flash bulb off, using a soldering iron. For tips on soldering, check out the [https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/How+To+Solder+and+Desolder+Connections/750|Soldering Technique Guide].</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">8</has_order>
