  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Beginning in one of the corners, use a spudger to pry the leather casing off of the camera. When working with electronics, it's important to choose a tool that's ESD-safe to avoid accidental damage to the device. The metal spudger is great when you need serious prying power, but the regular black nylon spudger or a plastic opening tool should be used whenever possible.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

