  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Using your fingers, carefully disconnect the connector ribbons. Though various guides suggest using a plastic or metal spudger tool to disconnect the ribbons, this tool is liable to damage the connectors.</has_title>
