  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">While holding the camera, take note of each screw holding the screen to the main chassis of the camera. Hold the camera upright and lens facing towards you. There area total of six 4mm PH00 screws to undo - two  on the left, one screw on the right, and three along the bottom. Two of them are hidden behind the battery compartment door.</has_title>
