  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">With the screws removed, use the plastic opening tool to gently pry the screen away from the main camera chassis. The ideal spot to start is at the corner with the headphone jack, as indicated in the picture. Once this side is free, gently work your way along the edge, all the way around the camera body.</has_title>
