  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Push the rear face plate from the short side nearest the screws you just removed towards the other short side of the camera.  It should slide forward and unlock the clips holding it in place. Then it should be easy to simply lift the rear face plate up and remove it.</has_title>
