  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Lay the camcorder on its side. The arrow key button is now in full view. There is a small green piece locking in the arrow key button. Once you remove that, the piece will be able to come out. Gently push on the button and it will come out of the device. Replace as needed</has_title>
