  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Locate the three silver screws on the top of the lens, and remove them using the Phillips #000 screwdriver Locate the two screws on the right side of the lens, and remove them with the Phillips #000 screwdriver. After removing the screws, the lens will just lift free from the black component.</has_title>
