  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The two  30 mm Phillips #0 screws left can be removed to gain access to the circuit board along with the LED. From here we can pop out the LED using the wedge or your fingers if you can manage it.</has_title>
