  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Carefully remove the clear tape covering the screws and the ribbon cable. Be careful not to tear the ribbon cable when removing the tape. We want to remove the larger silver panel (right).  The best way to do this  is to slightly bend the cover backwards and use the tweezers to grab a corner and slowly lift the screen up and out.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

