  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Use the spudger to pry up each side of the lens assembly '''Flat-Topped Connector''' at the bottom of the motherboard. Holding back the lens assembly ribbon cable, use the spudger to lift the '''Zero Insertion Force (ZIF)'''  connector tab .  Slide out the ribbon cable. Be sure you are prying up on the hinged retaining flap, not the connector itself. Use the spudger to lift the '''Zero Insertion Force (ZIF)'''  connector tab located on the flash unit.  Remove the ribbon cable.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</has_order>
