  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Locate the ZIF cable at the bottom of the main board. Disconnect the cable with the tweezers by pulling it away from where the cable is connected. Be careful not tug too hard on the cable as you can damage it.</has_title>
