  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the three black 5-mm T6 type screws using a Torx screwdriver located along the metal casing of the image sensor. The image sensor is very sensitive, be sure not to smudge the filter covering. Pull the image sensor out and it can now be replaced.</has_title>
