  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the 2 outer 5mm screws using the size J000 screwdriver. Remove the one 5mm screw on the left and the two 4mm screws on the bottom. Remove the two 2mm screws located above the screen on the back of the camera.</has_title>
