  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Working on your electronic device while it is powered on can result in electric shock. Power off, unplug, and remove the battery of your device before continuing. Close the battery door, and turn the camera over so that the bottom of the camera is facing up. Using a PH000 screwdriver, remove the two 5.5mm screws.</has_title>
