  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Take the spudger and wedge it very carefully between the LCD screen and the very thin and fragile frame. Very carefully make your way around the frame with the spudger, while making sure not to use too much force. Otherwise the screen will be damaged.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">8</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

