  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Use a pry tool to push the highlighted blue latch away from the battery in the direction of the arrow. Remove the battery. Use the''' Phillips 000 Bit '''to remove all screws from the perimeter of the device. Set aside. Use a small '''Plastic Opening Tool ''' at the seam by the Micro USB plug. Separate the plastic case from the device.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

