  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Flip the small blue switch up to release the battery. Remove the battery. Remove two Philips #000 screws. Place the screws on a magnetic pad or somewhere safe. Insert a plastic opening tool in the corner by the Micro USB plug. This area will allow leverage in order to take off the  outer case.</has_title>
