  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The pliers help to not burn your fingers. See on 2nd picture how much space we save with the hilium connectors. On 3rd picture we see how solder punctured the electrical tape. In the next step we add another layer for security.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">17</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

