  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Using a PH1 screwdriver, remove the two 8mm screws holding the plastic base  to the metal base of the camera. Be sure to keep track of your screws and washers. Using the correct Phillips Head screwdriver will help prevent stripping the screws. Careful when lifting the plastic base away from the metal base. There are two chords that may be damaged if pulled on.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

