  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">'''Make sure the device is turned off and unplugged ''completely'' before attempting any more disassembly .''' Unscrew the two 10mm screws holding the plastic camera base to the metal camera base using the PH1 screwdriver. '''Be aware that cables are still connected under this base,''' and gently lift the plastic base with the camera away from the metal base with the motherboard.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

