  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Flip the camera upside down to find the battery compartment (marked CARD/ BATT. OPEN). Press into the grooves of the battery door and slide the panel in the direction of the arrow.</has_title>
