  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the two screws for the metal plate on the bottom. Detach the no fuse ribbon cables by sliding them out. Detach the ZIF connector cables by flipping the small black holder in an upright position and then sliding the cable out carefully. Remove ribbons slowly and carefully or they '''WILL''' rip. Screws are of Phillips type, head size Y0 and 0.3 mm in length.</has_title>
