  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Hold the camera so you can see the motherboard on its bottom. With a pair of straight tweezers, carefully remove the hanging panel by the following bundled cable connectors and ribbon cable connector attached to the motherboard. At this point, the side panel that has been hanging should now be removed and placed to the side.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">23</has_order>
