  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Use the Phillips #00 head to remove the 5.5mm screw inside the metal casing. This screw may be hidden under the black strip inside the camera's body. If so, carefully move it aside with the pair of straight tweezers.</has_title>
