  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Unscrew and remove the eight1.2mm Phillips 00 screws. Make sure to apply adequate pressure while unscrewing these screws to avoid stripping them. Removing these screws will loosen the plates which cover the LCD screen.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</has_order>
