  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Use some standard '''micro USB''' male  connector/cable You can connect some remote shutter to it, or just a button which allows the lines to connect. Pinout as is on the picture ''sorry for the drawing of microUSB, it looks like half female (because of the inside) and half male. It's supposed to be male connector. But the positions of the pins are correct.''</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</has_order>
