  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure your hands are dry and you are working in a dry area. To prevent damage, do not touch the lens. There are two Phillips #00 6.0mm screws keeping the camera in place. Remove the screws first. Gently unplug the camera from the motherboard, and remove the camera.</has_title>
