  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Open the cassette holder to reveal a 2.4 mm screw on the bottom of the camera and remove it. Make sure the camera operation buttons are positioned completely outside of the camera frame. Gently lift the microphone housing from the front-bottom side of the camera and remove it from the frame.</has_title>
