  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Using the soldering iron, disconnect the four wires soldered to the main board. For more information on how to solder and desolder connections, please visit [https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/How+To+Solder+and+Desolder+Connections/750|this guide]. Be careful when using the hot soldering iron. Move the ribbon cable out of the way as well; it is easy to burn it or yourself when using the iron. Remove the main board.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

