  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove 2 screws on the bottom of the case, adjacent to the tripod mount. Note that these screws are slightly shorter than the previous ones and so should be kept separate. Ease off the case back. You can help it off by inserting a spudger in the crack on all sides to ease it, especially either side of any points where it seems reluctant to come.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</has_order>
