  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Once again use the spudger to gently open the encasement. The case is a little fragile and forceful entry could lead to damage of the plastic case. Thread carefully. The Battery can be safely detached and replaced.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

