  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Use a plastic opening tool to start separating the plastic housing from the front side of the battery cover. Next,  start separating the plastic cover from the rear of the plastic housing, and work your way down the seam line. Make sure the plastics snaps on the front of the plastic get unhooked from the grey plastic ring around the front of the camera.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</has_order>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</has_order>
