  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Use the PH00 to pry open the display screen of the camera. Expose the display screen and make sure the cable connecting the screen and the camera are separated. Remember where the cable connection is located to attach the replacement screen. Use the [https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/How+To+Solder+and+Desolder+Connections/750|How to Solder and Desolder Connections Guide] to remove the screen from the device.</has_title>
  <has_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</has_order>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

