  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Carefully pry open backplate from camera to expose LCD connector (white wire). LCD connector is attached with a metal bar to the motherboard. Use tweezers to gently pry metal bar connector from camera motherboard.</has_title>
